{"id":"glitchtext","code":"<style>.glt{position:relative;font:900 42px Inter,sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#fff);letter-spacing:-.02em}\n.glt::before,.glt::after{content:attr(data-t);position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;overflow:hidden}\n.glt::before{color:#ff2e88;animation:gl1 2s infinite linear alternate}\n.glt::after{color:#2ee6ff;animation:gl2 2.4s infinite linear alternate}\n@keyframes gl1{0%{clip-path:inset(0 0 82% 0);transform:translate(-2px)}25%{clip-path:inset(50% 0 20% 0);transform:translate(2px)}50%{clip-path:inset(20% 0 60% 0);transform:translate(-1px)}75%{clip-path:inset(72% 0 5% 0);transform:translate(1px)}100%{clip-path:inset(12% 0 70% 0)}}\n@keyframes gl2{0%{clip-path:inset(62% 0 10% 0);transform:translate(2px)}50%{clip-path:inset(20% 0 52% 0);transform:translate(-2px)}100%{clip-path:inset(42% 0 30% 0);transform:translate(1px)}}</style>\n<div class=\"glt\" data-t=\"GLITCH\">GLITCH</div>"}